## 5. 数据准备

### 5.1 一次性依赖

- ViECap `checkpoints.zip` → `checkpoints/`、`annotations/`
- MeaCap 记忆库 → `data/memory/coco/`, `data/memory/flickr30k/`
- 本地模型：gpt2、clip-vit-base-patch32、flan-t5-base-VG-factual-sg、all-MiniLM-L6-v2

### 5.2 COCO

```bash
# 实体 + CLIP 文本特征（或使用 ViECap 预处理好 pickle）
python entities_extraction.py
python texts_features_extraction.py

# ILR 邻居索引
bash scripts/build_ilr_neighbors_coco.sh 0
# 或手动：
python ilr/build_ilr_neighbors.py \
  --path_of_datasets ./annotations/coco/coco_texts_features_ViT-B32.pickle \
  --output_path ./annotations/coco/coco_ilr_neighbors_k5_seed30_var0.04.json \
  --ilr_k 5 --ilr_variance 0.04 --seed 30 --device cuda:0

# 图像特征 + C³ 均值（启用 REMOVE_MEAN 时需要）
python images_features_extraction.py
python compute_embed_means.py \
  --path_of_text_features ./annotations/coco/coco_texts_features_ViT-B32.pickle \
  --path_of_image_features ./annotations/coco/test_captions_ViT-B32.pickle
```

### 5.3 Flickr30k

将路径中 `coco` 换为 `flickr30k`，ILR 使用 `bash scripts/build_ilr_neighbors_flickr30k.sh 0`。

### 5.4 NoCaps 评测额外要求

- `annotations/nocaps/nocaps_corpus_ViT-B32.pickle`
- `annotations/nocaps/in_domain/`（或 `in-domain/` / `val/`）原始图片

