## 7. 消融实验模板

### 7.1 ilr_k 扫描（固定 ilr_variance=0.04）

```bash
for K in 3 5 7 9 10; do
  EXP="train_coco_k${K}"
  ILR_JSON="./annotations/coco/coco_ilr_neighbors_k${K}_seed30_var0.04.json"
  # 建 JSON → 训练 --ilr_k ${K} --out_dir checkpoints/${EXP}
  # 评测：MEMORY_CAPTION_NUM=${K} bash scripts/eval_coco_meacap.sh ${EXP} 0 14
done
```

### 7.2 ilr_variance 扫描（固定 ilr_k=5）

```bash
for VAR in 0.02 0.04 0.06 0.08; do
  EXP="train_coco_var${VAR}"
  ILR_JSON="./annotations/coco/coco_ilr_neighbors_k5_seed30_var${VAR}.json"
  # build_ilr_neighbors --ilr_variance ${VAR}
  # 训练读 --ilr_neighbors_path "${ILR_JSON}"
done
```

### 7.3 noise_variance 扫描（固定 ILR JSON）

```bash
for NVAR in 0.008 0.016 0.024 0.032; do
  EXP="train_coco_nvar${NVAR}"
  # 训练加 --noise_variance ${NVAR}，ILR JSON 共用 k5_var0.04
  # 推理不传 noise_variance
done
```

